    "name": "LE FOL",
    "steam_appid": 3472140,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3472140/extras/02bcf41b0cf41992b51d6b83cd7c0763.poster.avif?t=1754447632\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3472140/extras/02bcf41b0cf41992b51d6b83cd7c0763.webm?t=1754447632\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3472140/extras/02bcf41b0cf41992b51d6b83cd7c0763.mp4?t=1754447632\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3472140/extras/8ea0ee2371711453d815ecc2e57cac2c.webp?t=1754447632\" width=600 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >LE FOL is a visual experience inspired by the Fool\u2019s Journey, a point-and-click, multiple ending narrative game, full of puzzles and poetry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3472140/extras/3a56bcd46efae182d911fb4b771ef900.avif?t=1754447632\" width=600 height=102 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3472140/extras/0e9a7806439feaa55c6045dc002763bd.poster.avif?t=1754447632\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3472140/extras/0e9a7806439feaa55c6045dc002763bd.webm?t=1754447632\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3472140/extras/0e9a7806439feaa55c6045dc002763bd.mp4?t=1754447632\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world that mixes reality with the Tarot universe, the protagonist, apathetic and disconnected from life itself, goes on an intense journey of self-knowledge through the Major Arcana, which represents a specific aspect of LE FOL's life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3472140/extras/ca05e9ef9a6dfd08d6124e6b794102a0.avif?t=1754447632\" width=600 height=102 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3472140/extras/42b013b0a60db1f5301500b693913a8a.poster.avif?t=1754447632\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3472140/extras/42b013b0a60db1f5301500b693913a8a.webm?t=1754447632\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3472140/extras/42b013b0a60db1f5301500b693913a8a.mp4?t=1754447632\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With an unique 2D isometric visual style, inspired by analog art and impressionist movements, explore the contrast between the density and solidness of S\u00e3o Paulo and the fluidity of the natural world, which creates a setting that is simultaneously challenging and welcoming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3472140/extras/5f3a49c6ae3d6dc6bcc36c1987331dc5.avif?t=1754447632\" width=600 height=102 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3472140/extras/be2fc0e249a2ee2ae685d20a4a2f2db1.poster.avif?t=1754447632\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3472140/extras/be2fc0e249a2ee2ae685d20a4a2f2db1.webm?t=1754447632\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3472140/extras/be2fc0e249a2ee2ae685d20a4a2f2db1.mp4?t=1754447632\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout your journey, solve thematic puzzles associated with each Arcana, creating, combining and organizing objects and solving the problems presented to LE FOL.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3472140/extras/ea676e60186613bc7d91ad7f74d17895.avif?t=1754447632\" width=600 height=102 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3472140/extras/5e6845b60ff76d259fae9d4bb869a9ad.poster.avif?t=1754447632\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3472140/extras/5e6845b60ff76d259fae9d4bb869a9ad.webm?t=1754447632\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3472140/extras/5e6845b60ff76d259fae9d4bb869a9ad.mp4?t=1754447632\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Express yourself through the character and Diary customization.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3472140/extras/dff91b59d87f14c2d75445fc285c7889.avif?t=1754447632\" width=600 height=102 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3472140/extras/f3f5d6f6451028f2883aba0d227010ea.poster.avif?t=1754447632\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3472140/extras/f3f5d6f6451028f2883aba0d227010ea.webm?t=1754447632\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3472140/extras/f3f5d6f6451028f2883aba0d227010ea.mp4?t=1754447632\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Like a howl to space and the absolute void, like a voice that doesn't come out, LE FOL uses its own poetry as a way of expressing themself to the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3472140/extras/02bcf41b0cf41992b51d6b83cd7c0763.poster.avif?t=1754447632\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3472140/extras/02bcf41b0cf41992b51d6b83cd7c0763.webm?t=1754447632\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3472140/extras/02bcf41b0cf41992b51d6b83cd7c0763.mp4?t=1754447632\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3472140/extras/8ea0ee2371711453d815ecc2e57cac2c.webp?t=1754447632\" width=600 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >LE FOL is a visual experience inspired by the Fool\u2019s Journey, a point-and-click, multiple ending narrative game, full of puzzles and poetry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3472140/extras/3a56bcd46efae182d911fb4b771ef900.avif?t=1754447632\" width=600 height=102 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3472140/extras/0e9a7806439feaa55c6045dc002763bd.poster.avif?t=1754447632\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3472140/extras/0e9a7806439feaa55c6045dc002763bd.webm?t=1754447632\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3472140/extras/0e9a7806439feaa55c6045dc002763bd.mp4?t=1754447632\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world that mixes reality with the Tarot universe, the protagonist, apathetic and disconnected from life itself, goes on an intense journey of self-knowledge through the Major Arcana, which represents a specific aspect of LE FOL's life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3472140/extras/ca05e9ef9a6dfd08d6124e6b794102a0.avif?t=1754447632\" width=600 height=102 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3472140/extras/42b013b0a60db1f5301500b693913a8a.poster.avif?t=1754447632\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3472140/extras/42b013b0a60db1f5301500b693913a8a.webm?t=1754447632\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3472140/extras/42b013b0a60db1f5301500b693913a8a.mp4?t=1754447632\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With an unique 2D isometric visual style, inspired by analog art and impressionist movements, explore the contrast between the density and solidness of S\u00e3o Paulo and the fluidity of the natural world, which creates a setting that is simultaneously challenging and welcoming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3472140/extras/5f3a49c6ae3d6dc6bcc36c1987331dc5.avif?t=1754447632\" width=600 height=102 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3472140/extras/be2fc0e249a2ee2ae685d20a4a2f2db1.poster.avif?t=1754447632\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3472140/extras/be2fc0e249a2ee2ae685d20a4a2f2db1.webm?t=1754447632\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3472140/extras/be2fc0e249a2ee2ae685d20a4a2f2db1.mp4?t=1754447632\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout your journey, solve thematic puzzles associated with each Arcana, creating, combining and organizing objects and solving the problems presented to LE FOL.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3472140/extras/ea676e60186613bc7d91ad7f74d17895.avif?t=1754447632\" width=600 height=102 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3472140/extras/5e6845b60ff76d259fae9d4bb869a9ad.poster.avif?t=1754447632\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3472140/extras/5e6845b60ff76d259fae9d4bb869a9ad.webm?t=1754447632\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3472140/extras/5e6845b60ff76d259fae9d4bb869a9ad.mp4?t=1754447632\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Express yourself through the character and Diary customization.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3472140/extras/dff91b59d87f14c2d75445fc285c7889.avif?t=1754447632\" width=600 height=102 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3472140/extras/f3f5d6f6451028f2883aba0d227010ea.poster.avif?t=1754447632\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3472140/extras/f3f5d6f6451028f2883aba0d227010ea.webm?t=1754447632\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3472140/extras/f3f5d6f6451028f2883aba0d227010ea.mp4?t=1754447632\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Like a howl to space and the absolute void, like a voice that doesn't come out, LE FOL uses its own poetry as a way of expressing themself to the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
